    "<p><strong>Proprietà</strong> (per $x, y&gt;0$): $\\log_a(xy)=\\log_a x+\\log_a y$, $\\ \\log_a\\frac{x}{y}=\\log_a x-\\log_a y$, $\\ \\log_a x^r=r\\log_a x$.\n       <strong>Cambiamento di base:</strong> $\\log_a x=\\frac{\\log_b x}{\\log_b a}$; da qui ad esempio $\\log_a b\\cdot\\log_b a=1$.</p>",
